<item><title>Mauritania&apos;s national dialogue debates restoring the Senate</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-s-national-dialogue-debates-restoring-the-senate-6191d6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-s-national-dialogue-debates-restoring-the-senate-6191d6/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>Participants are weighing whether to bring back the upper house that Mohamed Ould Abdel Aziz abolished after it refused to back his plans.</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:43:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" length="34560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritania announces start of Jumada al-Ula on Wednesday</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-announces-start-of-jumada-al-ula-on-wednesday-74796d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mr/mauritania-announces-start-of-jumada-al-ula-on-wednesday-74796d/</guid><category>Mauritania</category><description>The National Moon Sighting Committee said Wednesday, November 11, 2026, is the first day of the Islamic month of Jumada al-Ula, year 1448.</description><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:22:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" length="34560" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
